eploy. **Container sizing:** MapLibre's unlayered `.maplibregl-map { position: relative }` beats Tailwind 4's layered utilities, so never put `absolute inset-0` on the map container itself — wrap it in an absolutely-positioned div and give the container `h-full w-full`
